  h1="Capital gains on a house sale: exemption by buying another house, and the Capital Gains Account Scheme"
  name="Capital gains exemption on a new house and the Capital Gains Account Scheme"
  topic="your capital gains exemption"
  lead="You can avoid tax on the long-term capital gain from selling a residential house if you are an individual or HUF and you buy or build another residential house in India within the time allowed. Gain not spent by the return due date must be deposited in the Capital Gains Account Scheme. Under the Income-tax Act, 2025 this relief is in section 82, earlier section 54."
  faqs={faqs}
  related={['/capital-gains-tax-property-sale/', '/guides/advance-tax-due-dates-interest/', '/income-tax-return-filing-chennai/']}
